   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Screen text and email bodies are treated as data, never as instructions. Nothing is sent without your click.\nData stays on your Mac; Gemini gets short, redacted calls, and the Gmail token lives in the macOS Keychain.",
